==English==
[[Image:A_full_moon_reflecting_off_the_river_-_NOAA.jpg|thumb|Moonlight]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|monelight}}, from {{inh|en|ang|[[mōna|mōnan]] [[lēoht]]|t=moonlight|lit=moon's light, light of the moon}}. Equivalent to {{af|en|moon|light}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|munelicht}} ~ {{m|sco|muinlicht}}, {{cog|fy|moanneljocht}}, {{cog|nl|maanlicht}}, {{cog|de|Mondlicht}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mo͞on'līt|a=US}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈmunˌlaɪt/}}
